Here is a well-structured landing page using the available components, ordered for a typical conversion-focused flow. Each section is commented for clarity, and only the necessary components are imported. The .Responsive static field is used for each component, and the top-level Tailwind classes and styles.css import are preserved.

```tsx
import './framer/styles.css';

// Navigation at the top
import NavigationFramerComponent from './framer/navigation';
// Hero section
import CoreBenefitsFramerComponent from './framer/core-benefits';
import ButtonFramerComponent from './framer/button';
// Brand logos
import BrandLogosFramerComponent from './framer/brand-logos';
// Steps / Process
import StepsFramerComponent from './framer/steps';
// Testimonials
import TestimonialFramerComponent from './framer/testimonial';
